      "imageAlt": "Emma | Women's Oversized Faux Fur Coat",
      "description": "Indulge in modern winter luxury with the Emma Oversized Faux Fur Coat, a statement piece crafted to elevate every cold-weather outfit. Made from ultra-soft faux fur with a plush collar and relaxed silhouette, this coat blends warmth, comfort, and high-fashion elegance. Cozy, stylish, and effortlessly sophisticated—it’s the ultimate finishing touch to any winter look. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for chilly winter days, evening outings, city strolls, business meetings, holiday events, or any occasion where you want to look chic and refined. Pair it with boots, trousers, or a dress for a polished day-to-night ensemble. MADE FROM: Crafted from high-quality faux fur with a smooth polyester lining, offering long-lasting warmth, softness, and exceptional comfort. LENGTH: Hip-length design that ensures maximum warmth while adding a luxurious, fashion-forward touch to any outfit. FIT & SIZING: Features an oversized silhouette for a relaxed, cozy fit with plenty of room for layering. Model wears size S and typically wears sizes 36–38. For a less oversized look, consider choosing one size down. PROFESSIONAL DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Emma Faux Fur Coat isn’t just outerwear—it’s a symbol of warmth, style, and contemporary luxury. With its rich texture and chic oversized shape, it’s the piece you’ll reach for every winter season.",
