      "imageAlt": "Felicia | Women's Belted High Turtle Neck Cape Coat Jacket",
      "description": "Make a sophisticated statement with the Felicia cape jacket, a refined outerwear piece designed with timeless elegance. Featuring a high stand collar with a button closure, a self-tie waist belt, wide cape sleeves, and an asymmetric front, this tailored jacket creates a graceful silhouette that effortlessly elevates both casual and polished outfits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for office wear, business meetings, city outings, travel, evening dinners, special occasions, casual layering, and transitional weather. Pair with tailored trousers, dresses, skirts, or ankle boots for an elegant finish. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality woven fabric with a smooth, structured finish, offering comfortable wear and a polished look for season-to-season styling. LENGTH: Hip-length design with an asymmetric hem that creates a flowing silhouette while providing stylish everyday coverage. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed tailored fit, featuring a high stand collar with button closure, wide cape sleeves, an adjustable self-tie waist belt, and an asymmetric front for elegant layering and effortless movement. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Felicia Cape Jacket blends timeless tailoring with contemporary elegance, making it a versatile wardrobe essential for work, travel, and special occasions. Its sophisticated silhouette adds a polished finishing touch to any outfit.",
