      "imageAlt": "Eira | Women's Belted High Collar Zip Front Hooded Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay warm while keeping your silhouette polished with the Eira puffer jacket, a sophisticated cold-weather layer designed to balance cozy coverage with a flattering shape. Featuring a detachable hood, protective high collar, quilted padded construction, and adjustable buckle belt, this jacket brings a refined finish to everyday winter dressing. Ribbed cuffs and zippered pockets complete the design with practical details for cooler days. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday commutes, city outings, weekend plans, travel, shopping days, or casual winter occasions. Pair with jeans and ankle boots for a polished daytime look, or style over a sweater dress with knee-high boots for an elevated cold-weather outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted outer shell and padded construction for comfortable insulation and a structured seasonal look. Ribbed cuffs provide a snug finish at the wrists for added coverage. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a detachable hood, high zip-up collar, full front zipper, and adjustable buckle belt that defines the waist. Zippered side pockets provide convenient storage for small everyday essentials. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a structured yet comfortable fit that can be adjusted at the waist using the removable belt. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit, especially when planning to layer over sweaters or heavier knits. CARE: Gently spot clean as needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products, and always follow the garment care label for complete washing and drying instructions. The Eira Puffer Jacket combines cozy quilted padding with a waist-defining belt and versatile detachable hood for an effortlessly polished winter look. From weekday commutes to weekend outings, it’s an easy cold-weather layer that brings warmth-inspired comfort and refined style to your seasonal wardrobe.",
