      "imageAlt": "Brandi | Women's Drawstring Waist Zip Hooded Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay cozy while defining your shape with the Brandi puffer jacket, a versatile cold-weather layer designed for effortless everyday style. Featuring a quilted padded construction, adjustable hood, and cinchable drawstring waist, this jacket combines comfortable coverage with a flattering, customizable silhouette. The hip-length cut keeps the look modern and easy to pair with your favorite seasonal outfits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday commutes, casual outings, weekend plans, shopping days, travel, or relaxed cold-weather wear. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for an easy daytime look, or style with leggings, a cozy sweater, and sneakers for laid-back winter dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted outer shell and padded construction for comfortable warmth and a soft, structured feel. The lightweight design makes it easy to layer over sweaters, knits, and everyday basics. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a padded hood, concealed front zipper, and adjustable drawstring waist with metal-tipped cords. The waist can be cinched for a more defined silhouette or loosened for a relaxed fit, while the hip-length cut provides versatile everyday coverage. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable fit and adjustable waist for personalized shaping. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit, especially if you plan to layer over thicker sweaters or knits. CARE: Gently spot clean as needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products, and always follow the garment care label for complete washing and drying instructions. The Brandi Puffer Jacket combines cozy quilted padding, an adjustable hood, and a waist-defining drawstring for an effortlessly flattering cold-weather look. From weekday errands to weekend outings, it’s a versatile layer you’ll reach for throughout the season.",
