      "imageAlt": "Gisella | Women's Zip Front Long Sleeve Corduroy Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Bring rich texture to your cold-weather wardrobe with the Gisella puffer jacket, a cozy outerwear staple that gives classic quilting a stylish corduroy update. Featuring a ribbed corduroy shell, padded construction, and tall funnel neck, this jacket combines comfortable warmth with a polished seasonal silhouette. The full zip front and long sleeves make it an effortless layer for everyday fall and winter outfits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, weekend plans, travel, city days, or relaxed cold-weather wear. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for an effortless daytime look, or style with leggings, a chunky sweater, and sneakers for cozy weekend dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a ribbed corduroy outer fabric over a padded, quilted construction for a soft textured finish and comfortable seasonal warmth. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a tall funnel neck for added coverage, a full front zipper for easy layering, and long sleeves finished with ribbed cuffs. The corduroy texture adds dimension while giving the classic puffer silhouette a distinctive, elevated look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable everyday fit that allows room for layering over sweaters and seasonal basics. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer a roomier silhouette or plan to wear thicker layers underneath, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh scrubbing to help preserve the texture of the corduroy fabric. The Gisella Puffer Jacket combines cozy padded warmth with the rich texture of corduroy for a fresh take on everyday winter outerwear. Easy to layer and effortless to style, it’s a versatile seasonal piece you’ll reach for throughout the cooler months.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Bring rich texture to your cold-weather wardrobe with the Gisella puffer jacket, a cozy outerwear staple that gives classic quilting a stylish corduroy update. Featuring a ribbed corduroy shell, padded construction, and tall funnel neck, this jacket combines comfortable warmth with a polished seasonal silhouette. The full zip front and long sleeves make it an effortless layer for everyday fall and winter outfits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, weekend plans, travel, city days, or relaxed cold-weather wear. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for an effortless daytime look, or style with leggings, a chunky sweater, and sneakers for cozy weekend dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a ribbed corduroy outer fabric over a padded, quilted construction for a soft textured finish and comfortable seasonal warmth. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a tall funnel neck for added coverage, a full front zipper for easy layering, and long sleeves finished with ribbed cuffs. The corduroy texture adds dimension while giving the classic puffer silhouette a distinctive, elevated look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable everyday fit that allows room for layering over sweaters and seasonal basics. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer a roomier silhouette or plan to wear thicker layers underneath, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh scrubbing to help preserve the texture of the corduroy fabric. The Gisella Puffer Jacket combines cozy padded warmth with the rich texture of corduroy for a fresh take on everyday winter outerwear. Easy to layer and effortless to style, it’s a versatile seasonal piece you’ll reach for throughout the cooler months.</p>",
