      "description": "Make a statement in cooler weather with the Zahara puffer jacket, a modern outerwear essential that combines bold shine with an effortlessly relaxed silhouette. Featuring a glossy finish, padded construction, and roomy fit, this jacket brings a sleek, contemporary edge to everyday layering. The full zip front and long sleeves make it easy to style over sweaters, hoodies, and seasonal basics throughout fall and winter. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, shopping days, weekend plans, travel, city walks, or everyday cold-weather wear. Layer over a hoodie with jeans and sneakers for an effortless street-style look, or pair with leggings, a fitted knit, and ankle boots for a sleek seasonal outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a smooth, glossy outer shell and padded construction for a softly structured finish and comfortable warmth during cooler weather. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a full front zipper, long sleeves, and classic puffer construction for a clean, streamlined look. The glossy exterior adds a statement finish, while the roomy silhouette provides plenty of space for comfortable layering. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized, relaxed fit for easy movement and layering. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended roomy silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. For a closer fit, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid abrasive cleaners or harsh scrubbing to help preserve the glossy finish. The Zahara Puffer Jacket combines a high-shine finish, relaxed proportions, and cozy padded construction for an effortlessly modern cold-weather look. Easy to layer over everything from sweaters to hoodies, it’s a standout outerwear piece for everyday fall and winter styling.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Make a statement in cooler weather with the Zahara puffer jacket, a modern outerwear essential that combines bold shine with an effortlessly relaxed silhouette. Featuring a glossy finish, padded construction, and roomy fit, this jacket brings a sleek, contemporary edge to everyday layering. The full zip front and long sleeves make it easy to style over sweaters, hoodies, and seasonal basics throughout fall and winter. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, shopping days, weekend plans, travel, city walks, or everyday cold-weather wear. Layer over a hoodie with jeans and sneakers for an effortless street-style look, or pair with leggings, a fitted knit, and ankle boots for a sleek seasonal outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a smooth, glossy outer shell and padded construction for a softly structured finish and comfortable warmth during cooler weather. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a full front zipper, long sleeves, and classic puffer construction for a clean, streamlined look. The glossy exterior adds a statement finish, while the roomy silhouette provides plenty of space for comfortable layering. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized, relaxed fit for easy movement and layering. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended roomy silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. For a closer fit, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid abrasive cleaners or harsh scrubbing to help preserve the glossy finish. The Zahara Puffer Jacket combines a high-shine finish, relaxed proportions, and cozy padded construction for an effortlessly modern cold-weather look. Easy to layer over everything from sweaters to hoodies, it’s a standout outerwear piece for everyday fall and winter styling.</p>",
