      "imageAlt": "Delcie | Women's Hooded Drawstring Waist Zip Front Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay cozy with a flattering finish in the Delcie puffer jacket, a versatile cold-weather layer designed for effortless everyday styling. Featuring a quilted padded body, attached hood, and adjustable drawstring waist, this jacket combines comfortable coverage with a customizable silhouette. The full zip front keeps layering simple, while the hip-length design pairs easily with everything from denim to casual winter essentials. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, weekend plans, travel, shopping days, or city walks. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for an easy daytime look, or style with leggings, a cozy sweater, and sneakers for relaxed cold-weather dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted padded construction for comfortable warmth and a softly structured feel. The lightweight design makes it easy to layer over sweaters, knits, and everyday basics throughout the cooler months. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and an adjustable drawstring waist for personalized shaping. The hip-length silhouette provides practical coverage while maintaining a clean, modern profile. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable fit that can be cinched at the waist for added definition or worn looser for a more relaxed silhouette. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you plan to layer over heavier sweaters, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the quilted construction and overall shape. The Delcie Puffer Jacket combines classic quilting, a practical hood, and an adjustable drawstring waist for an effortlessly versatile cold-weather layer. From weekday errands to relaxed weekend plans, it’s an easy seasonal staple designed to complement your everyday wardrobe.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Stay cozy with a flattering finish in the Delcie puffer jacket, a versatile cold-weather layer designed for effortless everyday styling. Featuring a quilted padded body, attached hood, and adjustable drawstring waist, this jacket combines comfortable coverage with a customizable silhouette. The full zip front keeps layering simple, while the hip-length design pairs easily with everything from denim to casual winter essentials. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, weekend plans, travel, shopping days, or city walks. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for an easy daytime look, or style with leggings, a cozy sweater, and sneakers for relaxed cold-weather dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted padded construction for comfortable warmth and a softly structured feel. The lightweight design makes it easy to layer over sweaters, knits, and everyday basics throughout the cooler months. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and an adjustable drawstring waist for personalized shaping. The hip-length silhouette provides practical coverage while maintaining a clean, modern profile. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable fit that can be cinched at the waist for added definition or worn looser for a more relaxed silhouette. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you plan to layer over heavier sweaters, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the quilted construction and overall shape. The Delcie Puffer Jacket combines classic quilting, a practical hood, and an adjustable drawstring waist for an effortlessly versatile cold-weather layer. From weekday errands to relaxed weekend plans, it’s an easy seasonal staple designed to complement your everyday wardrobe.</p>",
