      "imageAlt": "Charmaine | Women's Hooded Zip Front Side Pockets Quilted Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Step into colder days with the Charmaine puffer jacket, a sophisticated longline layer designed to bring together cozy coverage and a streamlined silhouette. Featuring distinctive vertical quilting, an attached hood, and waist-defining side belt straps, this jacket offers a polished take on classic winter outerwear. The full zip front and below-the-knee length make it an effortlessly versatile choice for everyday cold-weather dressing. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for winter commutes, city walks, weekend outings, travel, shopping days, or everyday errands. Layer over a fitted sweater with jeans and boots for a polished daytime look, or pair with leggings and cozy knits for relaxed cold-weather styling. MADE FROM: Crafted with a padded construction featuring vertical quilted channels for comfortable seasonal warmth and a clean, structured appearance. The quilted design creates a sleek finish while remaining easy to layer over your favorite winter essentials. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and side belt straps at the waist for added shape and definition. Vertical quilting runs throughout the body, while the long hem falls below the knee for extended coverage and a streamlined finish. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable, layering-friendly fit and waist-defining side straps for a more shaped silhouette. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you plan to wear heavier sweaters underneath, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the padding, vertical quilting, and overall shape. The Charmaine Puffer Jacket combines sleek vertical quilting, practical hooded coverage, and waist-defining side belt straps for an elevated winter look. Finished in classic Black, it’s a versatile longline layer for daily commutes, weekend plans, and seasonal travel.",
