      "imageAlt": "Oriana | Women's Zip Front Long Sleeve Pockets Glossy Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Add a sleek statement to your cold-weather wardrobe with the Oriana puffer jacket, a cropped outerwear essential designed with a glossy finish and bold quilted texture. Wide horizontal padded channels create a classic puffer silhouette, while the high stand collar and attached hood provide additional coverage. Finished with a two-way front zipper and practical pockets, it brings together sporty styling and modern everyday versatility. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, weekend plans, city walks, shopping days, travel, or everyday cold-weather styling. Pair with high-waisted jeans and ankle boots for a polished casual look, or style with leggings, sneakers, and a fitted knit for an easy sporty outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a glossy outer finish and padded construction arranged in wide horizontal quilted channels across the body and sleeves. The structured puffer design provides comfortable seasonal coverage while creating a bold, contemporary look. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood positioned above a high stand collar, a two-way front zipper, long sleeves, practical pockets, and elasticated cuffs for a secure finish. The cropped waist-length silhouette balances the jacket’s voluminous quilting for a modern, flattering proportion. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a cropped puffer silhouette that finishes around the waist while leaving room for comfortable layering. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer additional room for thicker sweaters, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products and abrasive surfaces to help preserve the glossy finish and padded construction. The Oriana Puffer Jacket combines glossy texture, statement quilting, and a contemporary cropped silhouette for an effortlessly stylish cold-weather layer. With its practical hood, two-way zipper, and everyday pockets, it’s a versatile choice for casual winter looks, weekend outings, and seasonal travel.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Add a sleek statement to your cold-weather wardrobe with the Oriana puffer jacket, a cropped outerwear essential designed with a glossy finish and bold quilted texture. Wide horizontal padded channels create a classic puffer silhouette, while the high stand collar and attached hood provide additional coverage. Finished with a two-way front zipper and practical pockets, it brings together sporty styling and modern everyday versatility. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, weekend plans, city walks, shopping days, travel, or everyday cold-weather styling. Pair with high-waisted jeans and ankle boots for a polished casual look, or style with leggings, sneakers, and a fitted knit for an easy sporty outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a glossy outer finish and padded construction arranged in wide horizontal quilted channels across the body and sleeves. The structured puffer design provides comfortable seasonal coverage while creating a bold, contemporary look. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood positioned above a high stand collar, a two-way front zipper, long sleeves, practical pockets, and elasticated cuffs for a secure finish. The cropped waist-length silhouette balances the jacket’s voluminous quilting for a modern, flattering proportion. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a cropped puffer silhouette that finishes around the waist while leaving room for comfortable layering. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer additional room for thicker sweaters, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products and abrasive surfaces to help preserve the glossy finish and padded construction. The Oriana Puffer Jacket combines glossy texture, statement quilting, and a contemporary cropped silhouette for an effortlessly stylish cold-weather layer. With its practical hood, two-way zipper, and everyday pockets, it’s a versatile choice for casual winter looks, weekend outings, and seasonal travel.</p>",
