      "imageAlt": "Viera | Women's Casual High Collar Drawstring Utility Jacket",
      "description": "Refresh your everyday layering with the Viera utility jacket, a versatile casual essential designed with a clean silhouette and adjustable details. Featuring a high stand collar, secure zip-and-snap front closure, and drawstring waist, this jacket blends practical utility-inspired styling with a flattering customizable fit. Finished with roomy flap pockets, it’s an easy layer for transitional weather and casual everyday outfits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, weekend plans, travel, coffee dates, or city walks. Pair with jeans and sneakers for an effortless daytime look, or style over a fitted top with tailored pants and ankle boots for a more polished casual outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a structured outer construction that gives the jacket a clean utility-inspired appearance while remaining comfortable for everyday layering. Its versatile design works well over lightweight knits, tees, and seasonal basics. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a high stand collar, full front zipper with additional snap fastenings, long sleeves, and an adjustable drawstring waist for personalized shaping. Flap pockets at the hips add functional storage, while the hip-length silhouette keeps the overall look modern and easy to style. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable casual fit that can be cinched at the waist for added definition or worn looser for a more relaxed silhouette. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you plan to layer over thicker sweaters, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the fabric, hardware, and overall shape. The Viera Utility Jacket combines a high collar, adjustable drawstring waist, practical flap pockets, and secure layered closure for effortless everyday versatility. Its clean utility-inspired design makes it an easy choice for transitional weather, weekend outings, travel, and casual daily styling.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Refresh your everyday layering with the Viera utility jacket, a versatile casual essential designed with a clean silhouette and adjustable details. Featuring a high stand collar, secure zip-and-snap front closure, and drawstring waist, this jacket blends practical utility-inspired styling with a flattering customizable fit. Finished with roomy flap pockets, it’s an easy layer for transitional weather and casual everyday outfits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, weekend plans, travel, coffee dates, or city walks. Pair with jeans and sneakers for an effortless daytime look, or style over a fitted top with tailored pants and ankle boots for a more polished casual outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a structured outer construction that gives the jacket a clean utility-inspired appearance while remaining comfortable for everyday layering. Its versatile design works well over lightweight knits, tees, and seasonal basics. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a high stand collar, full front zipper with additional snap fastenings, long sleeves, and an adjustable drawstring waist for personalized shaping. Flap pockets at the hips add functional storage, while the hip-length silhouette keeps the overall look modern and easy to style. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable casual fit that can be cinched at the waist for added definition or worn looser for a more relaxed silhouette. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you plan to layer over thicker sweaters, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the fabric, hardware, and overall shape. The Viera Utility Jacket combines a high collar, adjustable drawstring waist, practical flap pockets, and secure layered closure for effortless everyday versatility. Its clean utility-inspired design makes it an easy choice for transitional weather, weekend outings, travel, and casual daily styling.</p>",
