      "imageAlt": "Giovanna",
      "description": "Introducing the ‘ Giovanna Mini’ – a refined fusion of sculptural tailoring and fluid elegance. Designed in a sophisticated pearl tone, this striking mini dress features long sleeves with buttoned cuffs and a delicate neck tie fastening that adds a touch of soft femininity to the structured silhouette. The design is elevated by subtle shoulder pads that create a beautifully defined shape through the shoulders, while the twist-front draped detailing sculpts the waist and enhances the silhouette. Crafted with fully pleated fabric and delicate glitter threads, the dress catches the light with every movement, creating an effortlessly luminous effect. The softly ruffled hem adds playful movement to the mini-length silhouette, balancing elegance with modern charm. Lightly semi-sheer in construction, the Giovanna Mini feels airy and graceful while remaining refined and sophisticated. WHERE TO WEAR: Cocktail parties, elegant dinners, festive celebrations, birthday events, evening gatherings, stylish city nights, and chic holiday occasions. UNDERWEAR SOLUTION: Seamless underwear or nude-toned underwear recommended. Stretch Factor: 2/3 Model: 1.73m (5'8\") wearing size XS.",
