      "imageAlt": "Eleonora",
      "description": "Introducing the ‘Eleonora Maxi’ – a striking blend of sculpted structure and fluid sophistication. Crafted in a timeless black tone, this gown features a beautifully structured bodice that sculpts and supports, paired with a refined straight neckline and adjustable tapered straps that frame the décolletage with understated elegance. The lace-up back adds a romantic, cinched finish that ensures a flawless, tailored fit. Flowing from the waist, the satin maxi skirt drapes effortlessly over the hips, creating an elongated, hourglass-enhancing silhouette. Its soft movement and luxurious sheen make every step feel cinematic. Eleonora Maxi offers a modern, elevated interpretation of the classic evening gown – sensual, polished, and undeniably sophisticated. WHERE TO WEAR: Black-tie events, elegant soirées, winter galas, luxury dinners, engagement celebrations, New Year’s Eve, red-carpet inspired moments. UNDERWEAR SOLUTION: Seamless underwear or nipple covers. Stretch Factor: 2/3 Model: 1.73m (5'8\") wearing size XS.",
