      "bodyHtml": "<p>Introducing the ‘Iris Mini Dress’ – a commanding expression of tailored power and refined femininity. Crafted in a timeless white tone from non-stretch woven suiting, this structured blazer mini dress is designed to sculpt with precision and authority. The single-breasted silhouette features sharp peaked lapels and long sleeves that create a strong, elongated frame. Multi hook-and-eye detailing runs down the centre front, adding a sleek, architectural edge. An adjustable waist strap cinches the waist to deliver a perfectly contoured, hourglass-enhancing fit. Balancing structure with movement, the pleated cowl mini skirt softens the look with subtle fluidity while maintaining its polished, executive presence. Fully lined and finished with an invisible side seam zipper, Iris Mini Dress is bold, sophisticated and unapologetically powerful. WHERE TO WEAR: Boardroom meetings, corporate events, fashion week moments, power dinners, networking nights, engagement celebrations, luxury city evenings. UNDERWEAR SOLUTION: Seamless underwear or nipple covers. Stretch Factor: 1/3 Model: 1.73m (5'8\") wearing size XS.</p>",
